data.content:
Build succeeds. Here's the fix:

**In MSTest v4, the `out` parameter overload of `Assert.IsInstanceOfType<T>()` was removed.** Replace:

```csharp
// Before (MSTest v3)
Assert.IsInstanceOfType<FastProcessor>(processor, out var typed);
```

```csharp
// After (MSTest v4)
Assert.IsInstanceOfType<FastProcessor>(processor);
var typed = (FastProcessor)processor;
```

The assertion still validates the type; you just cast explicitly on the next line. The cast is safe because the assertion would have already failed if the type didn't match.
